Panel variable: pid (unbalanced)
 Time variable: syear, 2000 to 2020, but with gaps
         Delta: 1 unit

.         sort pid syear

.         gen d_daughter = 0 if pld0026 == -2
(525,132 missing values generated)

.         replace d_daughter = 1 if pld0026 == 1 | pld0026 == 2 | pld0026 == 3 
> | pld0026 == 4 | pld0026 == 6 | pld0026 == 9
(43,058 real changes made)

.         tab d_daughter

 d_daughter |      Freq.     Percent        Cum.
------------+-----------------------------------
          0 |     48,712       53.08       53.08
